WEBVTT

00:02.250 --> 00:06.830
As we came out of the dark tunnel, we saw...

00:09.630 --> 00:11.250
Yay, the ocean!

00:11.250 --> 00:12.580
Photoshoot time!

00:12.580 --> 00:15.040
Whoa, and there are like, no people here!

00:15.040 --> 00:18.330
Not many people know about it.
Eri and I used it a lot for cosplay shoots.

00:18.880 --> 00:21.080
Let's go to the beach!

00:21.330 --> 00:23.540
I wanna get Nonopi out to the beach.

00:23.540 --> 00:27.250
Otaku don't like going to the beach. 
Right, Ririsa-chan?

00:28.080 --> 00:30.130
The beach is a great idea!

00:30.130 --> 00:31.790
Yes, a great idea indeed.

00:32.420 --> 00:34.580
The contrast of our skin
against the brilliant blue!

00:34.580 --> 00:37.250
Dramatic sunlight! Infinite shot angles!

00:37.250 --> 00:39.130
It's the perfect place for a shoot!

00:39.130 --> 00:41.630
Every cosplayer wants to
get pictures on the beach!

00:41.630 --> 00:43.170
And with Obon season over,

00:43.170 --> 00:44.960
and beach season dying down,
now's the perfect time.

00:44.960 --> 00:47.580
Jellyfish season is cosplay season!

00:47.750 --> 00:49.420
Jellyfish season?

00:49.420 --> 00:50.380
I see.

00:50.380 --> 00:52.290
You're thinking an overnight trip, right, Kisaki-san?

00:51.670 --> 00:52.290
An overnighter?!

00:52.290 --> 00:53.790
You're thinking an overnight trip, right, Kisaki-san?

00:53.790 --> 00:55.250
Yeah! That's the idea!

00:56.790 --> 00:59.170
Well, if it's for cosplay...

00:59.670 --> 01:01.960
A summer training camp trip, huh?

01:02.250 --> 01:06.040
Every sports anime has that episode.
Damn, this is totally gonna make us power up.

01:06.040 --> 01:08.670
So we are treating cosplay as a sport. Thought so.

01:08.920 --> 01:11.000
A sleepover with Senpai. A sleepover with Senpai.

01:11.000 --> 01:12.830
A sleepover with Senpai!

01:12.830 --> 01:16.920
Senpai, my modeling contract says no swimsuits,

01:16.920 --> 01:19.920
but I'll wear one just for you.

01:20.540 --> 01:22.630
Cool, can't wait.

01:22.630 --> 01:25.540
Yeah, yeah, I already know you don't really care!

01:27.000 --> 01:28.880
Wait a second, does Mikarin...

01:28.880 --> 01:30.420
...have a crush on Okumura?

01:30.710 --> 01:39.330
No way. She's a famous fashion model!
Why would she want a weirdo otaku like...

01:39.920 --> 01:42.080
The manga you made, the manga you created...

01:42.630 --> 01:45.080
Like him...

01:52.250 --> 01:57.380
Man, sometimes, 3D girls act so weird
I can't even tell what they're thinking.

03:30.000 --> 03:34.960
Manga Club On the Beach

03:35.830 --> 03:37.380
Girls in swimsuits...

03:37.830 --> 03:41.670
I couldn't care less... But I have to, for the art!

03:41.670 --> 03:44.420
Cosplay isn't 2D or 3D.

03:44.750 --> 03:46.790
At best, it's 2.5D, right in the middle.

03:47.710 --> 03:57.540
They call Erika the closest thing to 2D, 
but in my eyes, she's perfectly 2.5D.

03:57.540 --> 04:02.580
Photos are 2D, and you can use editing
magic to make them look even more 2D.

04:02.960 --> 04:04.580
Maybe what you're missing is that

04:04.580 --> 04:08.670
awareness that your cosplayer is a living,
breathing person.

04:08.670 --> 04:10.040
I need to see them as a person?

04:10.460 --> 04:14.080
As long as you see Ririsa as a life-size figurine,

04:14.080 --> 04:16.420
you'll never get a picture of a living, breathing Liliel.

04:19.790 --> 04:24.790
So, I'll never get good photos unless
I develop some kind of interest in 3D girls?

04:25.000 --> 04:26.460
Senpai!

04:32.210 --> 04:34.580
W-What do you think?

04:35.080 --> 04:39.080
I know you couldn't wait to see,
so I'm a little nervous to...

04:39.790 --> 04:41.250
S-Senpai?!

04:42.290 --> 04:44.290
No, show some interest, Okumura!

04:44.540 --> 04:48.500
If I want to get lifelike cosplay pictures,
I need to change my mindset!

04:48.500 --> 04:50.670
3D girls aren't figurines!

04:50.920 --> 04:53.830
I-It's okay. I shouldn't have expected you to care.

04:54.210 --> 04:55.670
You look great, Mikari.

04:58.500 --> 05:03.130
After all that, did Senpai just say
I looked good out of cosplay?

05:04.790 --> 05:06.250
Mikari?! Don't die on me!

05:06.250 --> 05:07.380
Did I mess that up?

05:07.380 --> 05:10.880
Hey, don't get ahead of us here, guys!

05:10.880 --> 05:13.290
Mikarin! Okumura!

05:15.790 --> 05:17.960
I bought this just for today!

05:18.330 --> 05:20.960
Though not like you would care that much, Okumura.

05:22.000 --> 05:26.630
No, you look great.
That color matches your bright personality.

05:27.500 --> 05:30.790
Thanks. I'm glad I went for yellow.

05:30.790 --> 05:35.290
Where's that come from?
What happened to him not caring?!

05:35.290 --> 05:37.420
Did I do that right?

05:37.830 --> 05:41.000
Sounds like you're taking my advice to heart, Okamura.

05:41.000 --> 05:42.750
Go on, tell me how I look!

05:42.920 --> 05:44.130
Don't need to.

05:44.130 --> 05:47.290
Hey! Most guys would be thrilled to see their
22-year-old teacher in a tight swimsuit!

05:47.540 --> 05:49.580
Wonder what Ririsa's gonna wear.

05:49.580 --> 05:52.710
Oh, shoot, I should've given her advice.

05:54.250 --> 05:56.290
Bet it'll be a disaster.

05:56.290 --> 05:58.960
Sorry that took so long!

06:03.460 --> 06:07.210
Sorry, I just couldn't get my hair right...

06:09.290 --> 06:11.420
Ririsa, the photoshoot's tomorrow.

06:11.420 --> 06:12.790
Wait, it is?!

06:13.170 --> 06:14.920
I'll go take my wig and wings off!

06:14.920 --> 06:16.670
Senpai, don't go into the light!

06:21.000 --> 06:22.080
I'm so sorry about that!

06:23.420 --> 06:24.880
Now I'm ready.

06:28.330 --> 06:29.960
Why'd my heart leap into my throat?!

06:28.960 --> 06:29.960
Senpai?

06:29.960 --> 06:30.880
Why'd my heart leap into my throat?!

06:31.080 --> 06:34.750
Y-Yeah, Ririsa, you look cu...

06:35.250 --> 06:37.420
S-S-S-S-Senpai, let's go!

06:37.420 --> 06:38.460
Mikari-chan?!

06:38.670 --> 06:39.710
Take this!

06:41.580 --> 06:42.380
And this!

06:43.880 --> 06:46.000
What're you waiting for, Okumura!

06:46.000 --> 06:48.250
Oh, right.

06:52.290 --> 06:55.790
S-Senpai, do you, uh... Work out?

06:55.790 --> 06:58.460
Yeah, all otaku work out.

06:59.080 --> 07:01.750
We do the One Punch Man routine,
then the HxH punches of gratitude.

07:01.750 --> 07:03.830
Pretty sure no one actually does those.

07:05.460 --> 07:06.880
Where's Nonoa?

07:07.540 --> 07:11.670
Hey, Nono-pi, come play with us!

07:12.630 --> 07:16.750
What's so fun about splashing
water or throwing a ball?

07:16.750 --> 07:17.710
Nonoa?

07:19.330 --> 07:21.000
You should go be with them.

07:21.290 --> 07:24.040
Okumura-senpai... Sure, but...

07:24.290 --> 07:28.960
There must be a reason why they like it so much.

07:28.960 --> 07:32.290
Why don't you go over there and
see if you can find out why?

07:32.290 --> 07:34.000
I guess I could.

07:36.880 --> 07:38.170
That feels nice.

07:38.170 --> 07:39.290
Nono-pi!

07:40.580 --> 07:41.960
Nonoa-chan!

07:41.960 --> 07:43.040
What are you doing?!

07:43.040 --> 07:44.250
Tossin' the ball around!

07:44.250 --> 07:45.880
The ball's not even here right now!

07:46.130 --> 07:48.130
Isn't this fun?!

07:48.130 --> 07:51.540
Your extrovert energy is kinda intimidating!

07:52.330 --> 07:56.330
But yeah, the water feels nice,

07:56.330 --> 08:03.000
and seeing you guys having so much
fun is kinda rubbing off on me, too.

08:03.420 --> 08:05.880
It's not like coming here
made a difference, though...

08:06.630 --> 08:07.460
Nono-pi!

08:07.460 --> 08:08.670
You're so cute when you're being tsundere!

08:09.000 --> 08:13.880
Hey, the lodge owner gave us a watermelon!

08:13.880 --> 08:15.000
Let's bust it open!

08:15.000 --> 08:16.460
Wow, three melons.

08:16.750 --> 08:18.330
Go for it, Senpai!

08:18.330 --> 08:20.750
It's more to the right! Wait, the left!

08:20.750 --> 08:23.670
Up, up, down, down, left, right, left, right, B, A!

08:23.670 --> 08:25.500
Don't confuse me with random cheat codes!

08:27.540 --> 08:29.460
Here you go, Nonoa-chan!

08:30.330 --> 08:31.460
Thanks.

08:33.880 --> 08:36.710
I'm not a big fan of watermelon.

08:36.710 --> 08:40.290
It reminds me of cucumbers and
how it's not really that sweet.

08:40.290 --> 08:43.580
Plus it's gross that it's red on the inside.

08:43.580 --> 08:45.750
Did a watermelon kill your parents or something?

08:45.960 --> 08:47.210
No, but...

08:47.920 --> 08:50.330
It definitely tastes better with friends.

08:52.960 --> 08:55.330
Go right! Now left!

08:55.330 --> 08:58.290
This isn't how the watermelon game is supposed to work!

08:58.290 --> 09:00.830
Careful, don't let that otaku fool you!

08:59.210 --> 09:00.830
Got any trash?

09:00.830 --> 09:03.460
Yeah, thanks.

09:04.960 --> 09:08.040
Okumura-senpai, you're kinda like a superhero.

09:08.040 --> 09:09.960
Wait, me?

09:11.880 --> 09:14.170
Usually when people talk to me,

09:14.170 --> 09:19.500
they want something out of it,
or just want to talk about themselves.

09:19.920 --> 09:24.460
Most people don't bother asking me what I think,
or trying to help me.

09:25.250 --> 09:28.080
You're the first person who did, Okumura-senpai.

09:29.630 --> 09:32.040
Sorry, was it too much?

09:32.670 --> 09:33.380
No.

09:34.210 --> 09:39.130
I just feel like you truly see me,
in every sense of the word.

09:39.130 --> 09:40.790
And that makes me happy.

09:41.040 --> 09:43.080
It makes me want to spend more time with you.

09:43.630 --> 09:44.960
It does?

09:45.580 --> 09:50.250
She thinks I truly see her?
What makes her feel that way, though?

09:51.630 --> 09:53.170
That's how I make you feel?

09:53.170 --> 09:53.960
Yeah.

09:56.500 --> 09:57.880
That smile.

09:57.880 --> 10:01.040
If I had my camera right now,
this would make a fantastic picture!

10:01.500 --> 10:03.170
Why'd I think that, though?

10:03.170 --> 10:05.540
Did I really just think a 3D girl was cute?

10:05.880 --> 10:08.790
That's it. I just need to puzzle this out.

10:10.170 --> 10:12.500
Thanks, Nonoa.

10:14.040 --> 10:15.710
I'm gonna take some great pictures tomorrow!

10:18.250 --> 10:21.040
Wait a second...

10:21.790 --> 10:25.330
Did I just improve my social link
with Okumura-senpai?!

10:25.330 --> 10:27.750
Maybe this'll unlock a new ending!

10:27.750 --> 10:30.250
I don't think I have to worry about Nonoa.

10:31.540 --> 10:35.710
Ohmigosh, we should totally go on
a night walk somewhere spooky!

10:35.710 --> 10:37.460
Ooh, that'd be fun!

10:37.460 --> 10:39.000
That's such a cliché.

10:39.170 --> 10:41.540
The perfect chance to glom onto Senpai!

10:41.540 --> 10:47.130
Trespassing onto private property
without just cause is illegal.

10:47.750 --> 10:50.380
As your club president,
it's my duty to keep us on the right side of the law!

10:50.380 --> 10:51.460
It's okay, actually.

10:51.630 --> 10:54.420
Landowner Approved!

10:51.630 --> 10:54.420
Abandoned Cemetery Tour

10:51.750 --> 10:54.250
The town tourism board has a legal option.

10:56.500 --> 10:59.830
Hey, Aria, are you scared of ghosts?

11:00.500 --> 11:03.880
They're like the number one thing that scares me!

11:07.290 --> 11:09.670
I saw something! I totally saw something!

11:10.710 --> 11:12.040
It's just a spirit floating around.

11:12.040 --> 11:14.210
You're supposed to say,
'Don't worry, it's nothing!'

11:16.380 --> 11:17.130
Sorry!

11:18.210 --> 11:19.420
That's right.

11:19.420 --> 11:21.040
He doesn't see me that way.

11:21.040 --> 11:23.080
I feel like an idiot for getting embarrassed.

11:23.420 --> 11:25.710
Wow, Aria's usually so strong and confident.

11:25.710 --> 11:26.670
W-What?

11:27.210 --> 11:28.540
She needs my help.

11:30.250 --> 11:32.460
Don't worry. I'm here if you need me.

11:33.500 --> 11:34.790
What the hell?

11:36.080 --> 11:38.880
Okay, well I need you, so...

11:38.880 --> 11:40.460
How is he so good at this?

11:41.710 --> 11:44.710
Did you see her?
She nearly leaped out of her skin!

11:44.710 --> 11:49.040
But the guy with her doesn't
seem affected in the slightest.

11:49.040 --> 11:52.670
We gotta give 'em a good scare
to get more tourists out here!

11:53.000 --> 11:54.040
Yeah!

11:55.580 --> 11:57.460
Look, Sensei, a spirit!

11:57.460 --> 12:00.250
Go easy on her, guys.

11:58.960 --> 12:00.250
Gotta catch 'em all!

12:00.250 --> 12:01.290
Hold on!

12:01.290 --> 12:02.920
Get back here!

12:04.920 --> 12:09.040
I wish I could've been with Senpai.
I totally drew the wrong straw.

12:09.750 --> 12:13.960
Nonoa looks totally chill.
Is she not scared of this stuff?

12:14.920 --> 12:19.330
Don't worry, I've got you.
I can exorcise most low-level spirits.

12:19.670 --> 12:22.540
Whoa... How is she so good at this?

12:29.380 --> 12:32.580
Okay, that is WAY freakier than a dinky floating soul!

12:32.580 --> 12:36.670
It reminds me of those urban legend monsters,
like the kunekune or Hasshaku-sama!

12:36.750 --> 12:38.830
That's too tough for me!

12:38.830 --> 12:41.380
I should ask the high priest what to do next time!

12:42.210 --> 12:44.500
This way! Don't let them see you!

12:44.960 --> 12:45.830
This way!

12:46.210 --> 12:47.250
Definitely not this way!

12:49.540 --> 12:51.290
Still nothing?!

12:51.290 --> 12:52.330
How?!

12:53.000 --> 12:56.380
What's wrong with you, Okumura?!
How are you not scared?!

12:56.380 --> 12:58.420
Do you just not believe in ghosts?!

12:58.420 --> 13:01.500
Huh? No, ghosts totally exist.

13:01.500 --> 13:03.710
Why would I be scared of
something I know is there?

13:03.920 --> 13:04.750
What?

13:05.130 --> 13:09.630
True otaku are always ready
for the supernatural to appear!

13:09.960 --> 13:14.500
I've practiced using superpowers in my mind,
just in case they ever awaken in me.

13:14.750 --> 13:18.330
I'm always prepared to receive a
ghostly visitor and their spiritual assistance!

13:19.920 --> 13:21.580
Otaku are crazy!

13:23.750 --> 13:25.130
You okay, Aria?

13:25.920 --> 13:28.420
I can't move. My legs are like jelly.

13:28.920 --> 13:31.630
Want me to carry you on my back,
or like a princess?

13:31.790 --> 13:32.670
Huh?

13:33.290 --> 13:37.750
Y-You're kidding, right?
You know I'm heavier than most girls.

13:38.080 --> 13:41.710
A-And I'm hardly a princess, so...

13:45.250 --> 13:46.380
Oh, God.

13:47.670 --> 13:49.290
I know this feeling.

13:50.580 --> 13:52.540
I can't deny it anymore.

13:53.880 --> 13:55.330
I've got a crush on him.

13:57.630 --> 13:59.210
Let's wait here for everyone to catch up.

13:59.580 --> 14:00.460
Sure.

14:00.920 --> 14:04.960
Okumura, I bet the girls love you.

14:04.960 --> 14:05.460
What?

14:06.330 --> 14:07.920
You're single, right?

14:07.920 --> 14:09.830
You're not dating Ririsa, or Mikarin?

14:10.000 --> 14:11.540
No?

14:12.130 --> 14:14.710
There aren't any girls you'd wanna date?

14:15.170 --> 14:17.540
Nah, I don't do 3D girls.

14:17.540 --> 14:18.580
Like, never?

14:24.170 --> 14:25.170
Well...

14:25.880 --> 14:28.580
I liked 3D girls when I was little.

14:29.330 --> 14:31.210
There was one girl I liked, too.

14:31.420 --> 14:32.380
Oh, whoa.

14:32.380 --> 14:37.290
But, then my mom hooked up with a
random guy and left me all on my own.

14:37.790 --> 14:41.250
That's when I stopped trusting people.

14:41.670 --> 14:45.210
If they're just gonna betray me,
why bother with them in the first place?

14:45.750 --> 14:48.380
No one thinks much of me, anyways.

14:48.790 --> 14:52.250
Life's easier when you don't care about opinions.

14:53.170 --> 14:55.830
Isn't that hard, though?

14:56.630 --> 14:59.710
Not when I have the 2D world.
It makes life worth living.

15:00.500 --> 15:03.710
It's probably saved my life
a hundred times without me realizing it.

15:04.380 --> 15:08.170
Liliel would never betray me.
She's always been there.

15:08.960 --> 15:10.710
But I guess lately, I'd say...

15:14.130 --> 15:15.830
Wait, are you crying for me?

15:15.830 --> 15:18.920
There are people who deal
with way worse than that!

15:19.250 --> 15:23.000
That doesn't mean your situation sucks any less!

15:23.000 --> 15:28.880
Everyone's lives are a mix of
happy moments and sad moments.

15:29.540 --> 15:33.920
We've all lived through sad moments,
so I know how much it must've hurt for you!

15:35.580 --> 15:36.960
That must have been so hard.

15:38.000 --> 15:38.830
Huh?

15:41.790 --> 15:43.380
Okumura, you're crying.

15:43.380 --> 15:44.210
I am?

15:44.960 --> 15:47.710
I guess no one's ever said that to me before.

15:48.290 --> 15:49.670
I don't know how to feel.

15:51.250 --> 15:52.380
Hey, Okumura.

15:54.130 --> 15:58.210
I would never betray the man I loved.

16:00.670 --> 16:05.630
Yeah, I know you're not that kind of person, Aria.

16:06.170 --> 16:09.710
Lately, I've started to think
that girls like that could exist.

16:10.130 --> 16:11.960
You do, so they must.

16:13.790 --> 16:14.750
Thanks.

16:15.630 --> 16:16.710
Sure.

16:17.000 --> 16:19.830
Hey, you guys okay?

16:20.670 --> 16:23.630
Aww, you guys were behind everything?

16:23.630 --> 16:25.670
Sorry!

16:25.670 --> 16:28.830
That was great.
That big one was really scary!

16:29.290 --> 16:31.750
The wriggly one that was like, three meters tall?

16:33.290 --> 16:35.040
That wasn't ours.

16:37.420 --> 16:39.460
It's time for the photoshoot.

16:40.080 --> 16:43.080
I want to help Ririsa achieve her
dream and make an awesome cosrom...

16:43.080 --> 16:47.920
Not just because I promised her,
but because I genuinely want to help.

16:48.670 --> 16:53.420
Her cosplay is already perfect.
The rest is up to me!

16:54.130 --> 16:55.880
Senpai!

16:57.460 --> 16:58.790
Let's do this!

16:58.080 --> 16:58.790
Yeah!

16:59.460 --> 17:02.080
Let's get started!
Eyes on the camera, everyone!

17:06.880 --> 17:09.170
Liliel, can you come take a look?

17:09.170 --> 17:10.380
Sure, Senpai!

17:10.670 --> 17:12.380
I think they look good, but...

17:12.580 --> 17:13.790
They're so good!

17:13.790 --> 17:16.500
The lighting is harsh, but it works,
considering the location.

17:18.710 --> 17:22.330
What is it, Liliel?
What do you need me to change?

17:22.330 --> 17:24.790
Oh, nothing, Senpai!

17:24.790 --> 17:27.920
The composition, the timing,
everything looks just like the manga!

17:27.920 --> 17:29.670
You can be honest, you know.

17:29.670 --> 17:32.330
I am! I don't see anything that needs fixing.

17:32.460 --> 17:36.380
We're already doing the best we can.

17:37.130 --> 17:38.630
That's right.

17:39.080 --> 17:43.000
We're doing our best,
but I haven't done better yet!

17:43.630 --> 17:46.130
I have to stop thinking
of Liliel as a figurine,

17:46.130 --> 17:48.460
or I won't be able to
capture the real, live Liliel!

17:48.830 --> 17:51.330
I need to tear down this mental wall,

17:51.330 --> 17:53.250
and capture the real, live Liliel in front of me!

17:54.000 --> 17:55.880
Not the 2D, not the 3D,

17:55.880 --> 17:58.330
but the 2.5D Liliel!

17:59.330 --> 18:02.250
Think, dammit! Liliel is your waifu!

18:02.250 --> 18:04.630
You're taking photos of your darling wife!

18:05.500 --> 18:06.170
It's not working!

18:06.170 --> 18:08.750
I can't imagine a world where
I can actually touch my waifu!

18:09.630 --> 18:13.250
Wait, why is Senpai only taking pictures of Liliel?

18:14.710 --> 18:16.500
Why won't you look at me?!

18:22.000 --> 18:24.040
How's your homework coming along?

18:26.500 --> 18:28.830
Looks about the same to me.

18:28.830 --> 18:29.960
Yeah...

18:30.540 --> 18:32.420
This one of Miriella is good.

18:32.420 --> 18:34.500
She feels like a real, live person.

18:34.500 --> 18:36.880
Really?! How, though?

18:37.330 --> 18:38.750
Try figuring it out on your own.

18:38.750 --> 18:41.380
You won't be able to do this again until you do.

18:41.380 --> 18:43.170
Um..

18:43.580 --> 18:46.330
Her face looks pretty?

18:46.330 --> 18:48.000
It's deeper than that, bozo.

18:48.000 --> 18:51.290
But, at least you can
recognize that she looks pretty.

18:51.710 --> 18:52.960
I always could.

18:52.960 --> 18:57.000
I mean, you don't have to be crazy
about flowers to know they're pretty.

18:57.250 --> 19:01.670
Mikari has always been pretty.
I thought she was pretty the day we met.

19:02.080 --> 19:02.920
But...

19:03.540 --> 19:06.670
He'd already given up on
real women around then, huh?

19:07.460 --> 19:08.750
This is tricky.

19:08.750 --> 19:13.080
Something about that hang-up is
stifling his skill as a photographer.

19:14.040 --> 19:20.630
If we could get that figured out on this trip,
it might help him grow as a person, too.

19:21.880 --> 19:26.290
When I saw Miriella in that moment,
I felt something inside.

19:26.750 --> 19:29.210
But what was it?

19:30.460 --> 19:32.880
And back then, and that moment, too...

19:33.290 --> 19:35.920
But what? And why?

19:40.330 --> 19:44.500
Hey guys, Okumura's dying on us.
Let's take a break.

19:44.500 --> 19:45.670
Okay!

19:47.750 --> 19:49.290
Senpai, you okay?

19:49.670 --> 19:52.040
Oh, hey, Miriella.

19:52.040 --> 19:54.670
Wow, you really are out of it.

19:56.920 --> 20:00.460
What's it actually like to have a wife?

20:00.710 --> 20:02.790
Wait, you want to get married already?!

20:02.790 --> 20:06.420
No, I'm just trying something for the shoot.

20:06.420 --> 20:07.540
Oh, huh.

20:07.540 --> 20:11.460
Like, what would it be like
to take pictures of my wife?

20:11.880 --> 20:13.580
Maybe it'd feel something like this?

20:13.960 --> 20:19.380
She's cute, always there for you,
and you feel totally relaxed with her.

20:19.670 --> 20:21.040
Yeah...

20:21.040 --> 20:25.460
I get nervous around Liliel, but right now,
I feel weirdly calm and relaxed.

20:26.210 --> 20:31.080
Is it because the person in the
cosplay is my childhood friend?

20:41.210 --> 20:42.250
Hey, sleepyhead.

20:42.670 --> 20:44.080
How long was I out?

20:44.080 --> 20:45.420
About two hours.

20:45.420 --> 20:46.080
Huh?!

20:46.080 --> 20:48.790
It's fine. Everyone's having fun outside.

20:49.000 --> 20:51.710
Wait, were you here the whole two hours?

20:51.710 --> 20:53.710
Yeah, you looked cute.

20:54.130 --> 20:54.960
Sorry.

20:55.170 --> 20:58.540
Don't apologize.
I can hold out for two hours.

20:59.290 --> 21:01.500
I've held out for ten years already.

21:01.500 --> 21:02.250
Huh?

21:05.290 --> 21:06.580
Nothing.

21:07.790 --> 21:13.130
For a second, I saw Mikari inside of Miriella.

21:14.080 --> 21:15.000
That's it.

21:15.000 --> 21:18.420
This 2D angel didn't come
down from heaven on her own!

21:18.920 --> 21:20.830
Mikari brought her down to earth!

21:21.330 --> 21:22.830
It's the cosplayer!

21:23.040 --> 21:24.250
Senpai!

21:24.630 --> 21:26.960
You have to hear what Aria-chan told us!

21:27.080 --> 21:29.790
She... She saw a sea cucumber and...

21:27.630 --> 21:30.790
Guys! You promised you wouldn't tell anyone!

21:32.420 --> 21:33.830
Now you have to tell us.

21:35.460 --> 21:40.380
Senpai... When did you start
looking at other girls like that?

21:45.000 --> 21:47.130
He's never looked at me like that.

21:49.750 --> 21:50.830
Mikari-chan?

21:53.460 --> 21:54.630
Is she crying?

21:57.790 --> 22:02.330
Senpai lights up every time Ririsa enters the room.

22:03.170 --> 22:05.000
It's only a matter of time now.

22:05.790 --> 22:07.920
Mikari-chan, are you okay?

22:10.250 --> 22:11.250
Leave me alone.

22:11.580 --> 22:12.210
But...

22:12.210 --> 22:13.380
Just go!

22:13.380 --> 22:15.040
I'm your friend,
I can't let you cry out here alone!

22:15.040 --> 22:16.580
What's wrong?!

22:17.040 --> 22:17.920
I love him!

22:20.130 --> 22:24.330
I'm in love with Senpai.

23:56.000 --> 24:01.000
2.5-Dimensional Ririsa
